## Special cases:

## There is a resource-config.json file generated by nativeimage.gradle if you use Graal Native Image.
## Some usage may need extra resource configuration in a different file with the same name.
## You could also add that configuration to the text in nativeimage.gradle .
## You should delete or comment out the next line if you have configuration in a different resource-config.json .
# Source resource-config.json files are included in the backup.

# Display-sized textures regenerated by Gradle from original assets.
/assets/runtime/

# Standalone distribution archives are published as release assets.
/generated/distributions/

# Reproducible local character QA captures (JSON reports remain versioned).
/generated/puppeteer-preview/*.png
/generated/lobby-character-polish/*.png

# Local synchronized lobby transition captures.
/generated/lobby-start/

/generated/question-players/

/generated/previews/impostor-characters.png

# Local modular shotgun preview captures and QA configurations.
/generated/shotgun/

# Python tooling caches and scratch QA outputs; original assets remain local.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
/generated/tmp/

# Reproducible mobile presentation captures; keep the JSON report.
/generated/controller-polish/*.png

# Private voice-cloning references and machine-specific generation settings.
# Installed game voice clips under assets/ ARE versioned.
/tools/host-tts/reference/*
!/tools/host-tts/reference/README.md
/tools/host-tts/config/local.json
/tools/host-tts/config/*.local.json
/tools/host-tts/config/*.lock
/tools/host-tts/output/
/tools/host-tts/models/
/tools/host-tts/.cache/
/voice_sample!.wav

# Browser development dependencies and generated bundle
web3d/node_modules/
web/last-command-3d/app.js
web/last-command-3d/app.js.map

# Runtime copies introduced by the dynamic Last Command task panels.
!assets/models/last_command/*/animal_panel.glb
!assets/models/last_command/panel_lamps.png
!assets/models/last_command/hole1.png

# Last Command supplied audio and portable PCM runtime clips
!assets/sounds/last_command/*.wav
!assets/sounds/last_command/*.mp3
!assets/sounds/last_command/runtime/*.wav
!assets/sounds/last_command/runtime/*.mp3
web/last-command-3d/audio-test.js
web/last-command-3d/audio-test.js.map

# Four Last Command announcements generated by the existing approved host pipeline
!assets/audio/host/ru/events/PRESS_*.ogg

# Backup policy: retain source assets; regenerate build/QA output locally.
/generated/
node_modules/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
